Package: aspell-sv
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${aspell:Depends}, aspell (>= 0.60.8)
Provides: aspell6a-dictionary
Description: Swedish dictionary preview for GNU Aspell
 Swedish word forms derived from the original Aspell list and an expanded
 Hunspell source. The platform-specific dictionary hash is generated at
 installation time using the system Aspell engine.
 .
 This preview disables free compound joining to avoid known false positives.
 Correct compound words absent from the explicit list may be rejected.
